          "num": 1,
          "title": "Bedanya GENERAL dan CONDITION?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **GENERAL** \u2014 3 langkah, untuk aturan sederhana\n\u2022 **CONDITION** \u2014 4 langkah (+ Use Condition), untuk aturan kompleks\n\u2022 Pilih GENERAL dulu kalau baru belajar",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fed7aa;overflow:hidden;padding:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffbeb,#fff);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-align:center;\">GENERAL</div><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-size:7px;color:#475569;text-align:center;\">3 langkah<span style=\"display:block;font-size:6px;color:#94a3b8;\">Sederhana</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid #7c3aed;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f5f3ff,#fff);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7c3aed,#6366f1);font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-align:center;\">CONDITION</div><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-size:7px;color:#475569;text-align:center;\">4 langkah<span style=\"display:block;font-size:6px;color:#94a3b8;\">+ Use Condition</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Kenapa tombol Next tidak aktif?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Ada field wajib yang belum diisi\n\u2022 Cek: Rule Name, Risk Score, dan validasi error merah\n\u2022 Kalau semua sudah benar, tombol akan aktif",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">Validasi Error</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#991b1b;\">Field \"Rule Name\" harus diisi</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "History undo/redo berapa lama?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Menyimpan **50 langkah** terakhir\n\u2022 Setiap aksi (tambah/hapus/pindah/edit) = 1 langkah",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:center;\"><kbd style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;font-size:8px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Ctrl+Z</kbd><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">50 langkah</span></div>"
          }
        },
